# nen `submission_v2/` lot qua. Cung kieu loi da lam lot 15 anh keyframe khi
# doi ten thu muc (xem muc Benchmark_OCR_ASR o tren).
submission*/
sub_*/
*.zip
# Bai nop cua ky THI THU (20-21/08) da gom vao mot cho cho goc repo do bua.
# Luat rieng vi ten thu muc nay khong khop hai luat tren.
bai_nop_cu/

# ---- de thi BTC ----
# Repo cong khai. De thi la tai lieu thi, khong phai ma nguon -> khong duoc
# lo len GitHub cong khai.
de_thi/

# ---- ma nguon doi khac tai ve de tham khao ----
# Khong phai ma nguon cua ta: khac giay phep, va lam phinh repo. Doc thi doc,
# dung commit.
github_repo/

# ---- khoa API ----
# Repo CONG KHAI. File .env chua khoa that -> khong bao gio duoc theo doi.
# Mau khong co khoa thi dat ten .env.mau va commit binh thuong.
.env
.env.*
!.env.mau

